<h1><span lang="EN-US">MMIB Types</span></h1>
<hr align="center" size="5" class="whs3">
<p class="description"><span style="font-weight:bold;"><b>Description:</b></span> ModelMaker Interface Box (MMIB) is a unit that connects the sensor with the PC. Each family of ModelMaker sensors uses it own MMIB. The Z series use a MMIB-DL (D denotes digital and L denotes Laptop) which can be connected direct to a laptop or desktop PC.</p>
